947	     * that must ignore deleted owners (as {@link #rejectDuplicateIdentity(OwnerFieldsDto)} does)
948	     * filters them out itself. The owners are taken from the current set, so after a create the
949	     * result includes the newly persisted owner. An owner without a household (a {@code null}
950	     * identifier) belongs to no shared household, so an empty list is returned. This is the single
951	     * definition of a household's members, shared by every rule that reasons about the owners
